        "releaseChannel": "INTERNAL",
        "title": "BirdCoder2 Pad 0.1.0 pre-launch",
        "summary": "Standard-layout tablet scaffold; iPadOS and Android tablet packages remain disabled pending governed artifacts.",
        "content": "The Pad surface is the tablet-first composition root for the BirdCoder2 application. It consumes SDKWork app-api through injected app SDKs and owns no persistence of its own.",
        "highlights": [
          "iPadOS and Android tablet targets share one renderer and one package family",
          "Tablet adaptation contract covers four window classes, both orientations, and multitasking modes",
          "App, console, and admin surfaces remain separated with the backend-admin boundary isolated",
          "standalone and cloud deployment profiles both declared"
        ],
